    "detailed_description": "<strong>THE DESOLATION</strong> - THE ULTIMATE CROSS-PLATFORM CO-OP LOOTER SHOOTER<br><br>In an alternate future, humanity began colonizing our solar system just as an unknown alien threat invaded planet Earth. Humanity stood no chance against the aliens known as &quot;The Shade&quot;, and Earth as we knew it was gone. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/b1bd4d492c56c6ebd5a461d74e6c3970.poster.avif?t=1749753397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/b1bd4d492c56c6ebd5a461d74e6c3970.webm?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/b1bd4d492c56c6ebd5a461d74e6c3970.mp4?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FIGHT FOR HUMANITY</strong><br><br>Over 100 years later, you, a skilled mercenary, are the first to return to Earth. Your mission is simple, but nothing goes according to plan. Now, you face the most important mission of all: fighting for humanity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/2b6d96df292533256194e406c13f9427.poster.avif?t=1749753397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/2b6d96df292533256194e406c13f9427.webm?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/2b6d96df292533256194e406c13f9427.mp4?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>PREPARE FOR BATTLE</strong><br>Suit up, mercenary, and blast your way through The Desolation, a fast-paced co-op looter shooter for PC and mobile! Team up and fight your way through a unique universe to save humanity.<br><br>Upgrade your suit, collect better equipment, and unlock powerful skills to master co-op combat and eradicate &quot;The Shade&quot;!<br><br>The future of humanity is in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/82b165361654b720e56e8617d6ab9292.poster.avif?t=1749753397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/82b165361654b720e56e8617d6ab9292.webm?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/82b165361654b720e56e8617d6ab9292.mp4?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A MESSAGE FROM THE DEV TEAM</strong><br><br>Welcome to The Desolation!<br><br>We're thrilled to share this teaser version of the game, made in exclusivity for Steam Fest, so that you can get a taste of what The Desolation is cooking!<br><br>This demo contains only a fraction of the features in development such as: Procedural level generation, drone companions, a lot more gameplay modes, diverse environments, a roster of Exo Suits and a dive into the worlds of trans-humanism, wasteland dystopias and factions fighting over Earth's dominance.<br><br>Join the conversation over at our Discord server and actively participate in the development of the game by sharing your feedback with us!<br><br>The Desolation Team",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>THE DESOLATION</strong> - THE ULTIMATE CROSS-PLATFORM CO-OP LOOTER SHOOTER<br><br>In an alternate future, humanity began colonizing our solar system just as an unknown alien threat invaded planet Earth. Humanity stood no chance against the aliens known as &quot;The Shade&quot;, and Earth as we knew it was gone. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/b1bd4d492c56c6ebd5a461d74e6c3970.poster.avif?t=1749753397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/b1bd4d492c56c6ebd5a461d74e6c3970.webm?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/b1bd4d492c56c6ebd5a461d74e6c3970.mp4?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>FIGHT FOR HUMANITY</strong><br><br>Over 100 years later, you, a skilled mercenary, are the first to return to Earth. Your mission is simple, but nothing goes according to plan. Now, you face the most important mission of all: fighting for humanity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/2b6d96df292533256194e406c13f9427.poster.avif?t=1749753397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/2b6d96df292533256194e406c13f9427.webm?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/2b6d96df292533256194e406c13f9427.mp4?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>PREPARE FOR BATTLE</strong><br>Suit up, mercenary, and blast your way through The Desolation, a fast-paced co-op looter shooter for PC and mobile! Team up and fight your way through a unique universe to save humanity.<br><br>Upgrade your suit, collect better equipment, and unlock powerful skills to master co-op combat and eradicate &quot;The Shade&quot;!<br><br>The future of humanity is in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/82b165361654b720e56e8617d6ab9292.poster.avif?t=1749753397\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/82b165361654b720e56e8617d6ab9292.webm?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2358780/extras/82b165361654b720e56e8617d6ab9292.mp4?t=1749753397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A MESSAGE FROM THE DEV TEAM</strong><br><br>Welcome to The Desolation!<br><br>We're thrilled to share this teaser version of the game, made in exclusivity for Steam Fest, so that you can get a taste of what The Desolation is cooking!<br><br>This demo contains only a fraction of the features in development such as: Procedural level generation, drone companions, a lot more gameplay modes, diverse environments, a roster of Exo Suits and a dive into the worlds of trans-humanism, wasteland dystopias and factions fighting over Earth's dominance.<br><br>Join the conversation over at our Discord server and actively participate in the development of the game by sharing your feedback with us!<br><br>The Desolation Team",
    "short_description": "The Desolation brings a complete cross-platform co-op looter-shooter experience to PC and mobile devices. Make your impact across endless procedurally generated worlds via cooperative action combat, deep build customization and richly satisfying tactical gameplay.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
